ient's documentation has been sent to the wrong place.\nB. Nobody has taken responsibility for assessing the patient.\nC. The duty doctor was unable to locate the patient.", "sourcePage": 95, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 29, "prompt": "You hear the beginning of a training session for dental students.\nThe trainer is explaining that the session will\nA. focus on aspects of dental hygiene.\nB. expand upon what they studied previously.\nC. introduce them to a completely new technique.", "sourcePage": 95, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 102, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 30, "prompt": "You hear two nurses discussing the treatment of a patient with a kidney\ninfection.\nWhat is the female nurse doing?\nA. emphasising the urgency of a procedure\nB. suggesting how to overcome a difficulty\nC. warning him about a possible problem", "sourcePage": 95, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C"